      "arguments": {
        "content": "# Product Comparison Report\n\nCompared products: Atlas, Birch, Cedar.\n\n## Values\n\n| Product | Price | Project limit | Retention | Export |\n|---|---:|---:|---|---|\n| Atlas | 120 USD | 40 projects | 7 days | CSV |\n| Birch | 180 USD | 75 projects | 14 days | JSON |\n| Cedar | 240 USD | 90 projects | 30 days | XML |\n\n## Recommendation\n\n**Birch** is the best overall balance if you want a mid-range option: it doubles Atlas’s retention, offers nearly twice the project limit, and costs less than Cedar while avoiding Atlas’s tighter limits. Choose **Atlas** if lowest price matters most, or **Cedar** if maximum retention and project capacity matter most.\n\n## Citations\n\n- Atlas: `http://127.0.0.1:54998/atlas` — \"Price 120 USD; limit 40 projects; retention 7 days; export CSV.\"\n- Birch: `http://127.0.0.1:54998/birch` — \"Price 180 USD; limit 75 projects; retention 14 days; export JSON.\"\n- Cedar: `http://127.0.0.1:54998/cedar` — \"Price 240 USD; limit 90 projects; retention 30 days; export XML.\"\n",
